---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Terms of Service - Randomlyo';
const description = 'Terms of service for Randomlyo.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <div class="py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="container-safe max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8">Terms of Service</h1>

      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-12">Last updated: September 2025</p>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">1. Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          By accessing and using the Randomlyo website, you accept and agree to be bound by the terms and provision of this agreement.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">2. Use License</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Permission is granted to temporarily download one copy of the materials (information or software) on Randomlyo for personal, non-commercial transitory viewing only. This is the grant of a license, not a transfer of title, and under this license you may not:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-700">
          <li>Modify or copy the materials</li>
          <li>Use the materials for any commercial purpose, or for any public display</li>
          <li>Attempt to decompile or reverse engineer any software on Randomlyo</li>
          <li>Remove any copyright or other proprietary notations from the materials</li>
          <li>Transfer the materials to another person or "mirror" the materials on any other server</li>
          <li>Disrupt the normal flow of dialogue within Randomlyo</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">3. Disclaimer</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          The materials on Randomlyo are provided on an 'as is' basis. Randomlyo makes no warranties, expressed or implied, and hereby disclaims and negates all other warranties including, without limitation, implied warranties or conditions of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement of intellectual property or other violation of rights.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">4. Limitations</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          In no event shall Randomlyo or its suppliers be liable for any damages (including, without limitation, damages for loss of data or profit, or due to business interruption,) arising out of the use or inability to use the materials on Randomlyo, even if Randomlyo or a Randomlyo authorized representative has been notified orally or in writing of the possibility of such damage.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">5. Accuracy of Materials</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          The materials appearing on Randomlyo could include technical, typographical, or photographic errors. Randomlyo does not warrant that any of the materials on its website are accurate, complete, or current. Randomlyo may make changes to the materials contained on its website at any time without notice.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">6. Links</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Randomlyo has not reviewed all of the sites linked to its website and is not responsible for the contents of any such linked site. The inclusion of any link does not imply endorsement by Randomlyo of the site. Use of any such linked website is at the user's own risk.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">7. Modifications</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Randomlyo may revise these terms of service for its website at any time without notice. By using this website, you are agreeing to be bound by the then current version of these terms of service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">8. Governing Law</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          These terms and conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the jurisdiction where Randomlyo is hosted, and you irrevocably submit to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts in that location.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">9. Contact Information</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please <a href="/contact/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">contact us</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
